== <script> ==
0000    3 OP_CLOSURE          1 <fn answer>
0002    | OP_DEFINE_GLOBAL    0 'answer'
0004    5 OP_GET_GLOBAL       2 '@println'
0006    | OP_GET_GLOBAL       0 'answer'
0008    | OP_CALL             0
0010    | OP_CALL             1
0012    | OP_POP
0013    6 OP_NIL
0014    | OP_RETURN
== answer ==
0000    2 OP_CONSTANT         0 '42'
0002    | OP_RETURN
